{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# LR symmetry for ABJM: on-shell HW states and structure constants up to L = 4 pairs\n\n**2603.26617, Sec. IV \"Left-Right Quantum Symmetry\"** (N = 4 SYM, so(6) chain, quantum space 6 = ∧²ℂ⁴): besides R-charge, structure constants obey an infinite tower of conservation laws. With t₊(u) = Σ_j T_jj (aux 4) and t₋(u) (aux 4̄ = ∧³ fusion, trivial zeros stripped), t₊(u)† = t₋(u* + i), a state is **LR symmetric** iff τ₊ = τ₋. Eqs. (18)–(20): ⟨Q₂(ℬ − ℬ†)Q₁⟩ = 0 forces det⟨u^{β−1}Q₁₂⟩ ∝ δ_{AĀ}: **C_ℓ = 0 unless |Ψ⟩ is LR symmetric** (generic twists, ω = 1; untwisted version from their ref. [24]).\n\n**ABJM analogue (proposal, tested below).** At the ABJM point θ_A − θ_F = 2h (`abjm-chain.wb`) the t̄₃ Lax at u + h is the t̄₁ Lax with the roles of A and F exchanged: t̄₃(u+h): A → (u−θ_F) − hP, F → (u−θ_A) + hK, versus t̄₁(u): A → (u−θ_A) + hK, F → (u−θ_F) − hP. So with Π = cyclic shift by **one site** (exchanges the 4 and 4̄ slots — charge conjugation × half-translation):\n\nΠ t̄₁(u) Π⁻¹ = t̄₃(u + h),  Π² = S (pair shift),  [Π, H_MZ] = 0.\n\nΠ plays the role of 2603's LR map (4 ↔ 4̄). Define **LR symmetric ⇔ τ̄₁(u) = τ̄₃(u + h)**. A non-degenerate joint eigenstate is LR symmetric iff it is a Π-eigenstate; otherwise Ψ and ΠΨ form a pair with τ̄₁ ↔ τ̄₃ swapped (H_MZ-degenerate \"parity pairs\").\n\n**Plan.** (1) Check the Π relations. (2) For L = 2, 3, 4 pairs: all HW ∩ cyclic (S = 1) states, joint t̄₁, t̄₃ eigenstates at the ABJM point (untwisted), H_MZ energy, LR diagnostics. (3) Structure constants C_ℓ = ⟨B_ℓ|Ψ⟩/‖Ψ‖, ℓ = 0 … 2L (bra of `abjm-bridges.wb`: first ℓ sites O₂ fields A: e₁, F: e₄; rest O₃ fields A: e₁−e₄, F: e₄+e₁). (4) When does C_ℓ vanish?",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ee, rho, lax1, lax2, lax3, wedgeC, Dw, wedgeOp, applySite, typesOf, transferV, thAB, t1b, t2b, t3b, PiS, PiInv, siteOpL, PopL, KopL, HMZs, sectorsOf, JopL, braV, hwCyclic, analyse];\nnn = 4; hh = 1/2;\nee[i_, j_] := SparseArray[{{i, j}} -> 1, {nn, nn}];\nrho[\"A\"][i_, j_] := ee[i, j]; rho[\"F\"][i_, j_] := -ee[j, i];\nid4 = IdentityMatrix[nn, SparseArray];\nlax1[ty_][v_, t_][i_, j_] := (v - t) KroneckerDelta[i, j] id4 + hh rho[ty][i, j];\nlax3[\"A\"][v_, t_][k_, l_] := (v - t + hh) KroneckerDelta[k, l] id4 - hh ee[l, k];\nlax3[\"F\"][v_, t_][k_, l_] := (v - t - 3 hh) KroneckerDelta[k, l] id4 + hh ee[k, l];\nsubs2 = Subsets[Range[nn], {2}];\nwedgeC[k_, m_, Ir_] := Which[{k, m} == Ir, 1, {m, k} == Ir, -1, True, 0];\nDw[X_] := Table[Sum[X[[k, Jc[[1]]]] wedgeC[k, Jc[[2]], Ir] + X[[k, Jc[[2]]]] wedgeC[Jc[[1]], k, Ir], {k, nn}], {Ir, subs2}, {Jc, subs2}];\nDwE = Table[Dw[Normal[ee[a, b]]], {a, nn}, {b, nn}];\nwedgeOp[ty_][iI_, iJ_] := wedgeOp[ty][iI, iJ] = Sum[DwE[[a, b, iI, iJ]] rho[ty][a, b], {a, nn}, {b, nn}];\nlax2[ty_][v_, t_][iI_, iJ_] := (v - t - If[ty == \"F\", hh, 0]) KroneckerDelta[iI, iJ] id4 + hh wedgeOp[ty][iI, iJ];\n(* fast site action: contract the site index with BLAS *)\napplySite[psi_, s_, m_, L_] := Flatten[Transpose[m . Transpose[ArrayReshape[psi, {nn^(s - 1), nn, nn^(L - s)}], {2, 1, 3}], {2, 1, 3}]];\ntypesOf[LL_] := Flatten[Table[{\"A\", \"F\"}, LL/2]];\n(* untwisted reduced transfer matrix applied to a vector, aux dimension dA *)\ntransferV[lax_, LL_, ths_, v_, psi_, dA_] := Module[{tys = typesOf[LL], Phi, mat},\n   mat[s_, i_, j_] := N[Normal[lax[tys[[s]]][v, ths[[s]]][i, j]]];\n   Phi = Table[applySite[psi, LL, mat[LL, k, j], LL], {k, dA}, {j, dA}];\n   Do[Phi = Table[Sum[applySite[Phi[[m, j]], s, mat[s, k, m], LL], {m, dA}], {k, dA}, {j, dA}], {s, LL - 1, 1, -1}];\n   Sum[Phi[[i, i]], {i, dA}]];\nthAB[LL_] := N[Flatten[Table[{2 hh, 0}, LL/2]]];  (* ABJM point: theta_A = theta_F + 2h *)\nt1b[LL_][v_, psi_] := transferV[lax1, LL, thAB[LL], v, psi, 4];\nt2b[LL_][v_, psi_] := transferV[lax2, LL, thAB[LL], v, psi, 6];\nt3b[LL_][v_, psi_] := transferV[lax3, LL, thAB[LL], v, psi, 4];\n(* one-site cyclic shift Pi (site s -> s-1, site 1 -> site LL) and inverse *)\nPiS[LL_][psi_] := Flatten[Transpose[ArrayReshape[psi, {nn, nn^(LL - 1)}]]];\nPiInv[LL_][psi_] := Flatten[Transpose[ArrayReshape[psi, {nn^(LL - 1), nn}]]];\n(* Minahan-Zarembo Hamiltonian (sparse, numeric) *)\nsiteOpL[s_, m_, L_] := KroneckerProduct @@ Table[If[b == s, m, id4], {b, L}];\nPopL[a_, b_, L_] := Sum[siteOpL[a, ee[i, j], L] . siteOpL[b, ee[j, i], L], {i, nn}, {j, nn}];\nKopL[a_, b_, L_] := Sum[siteOpL[a, ee[i, j], L] . siteOpL[b, ee[i, j], L], {i, nn}, {j, nn}];\nHMZs[L_] := HMZs[L] = N[Sum[With[{l2 = Mod[l + 1, L] + 1, l1 = Mod[l, L] + 1},\n      2 IdentityMatrix[nn^L, SparseArray] - 2 PopL[l, l2, L] + PopL[l, l2, L] . KopL[l, l1, L] + KopL[l, l1, L] . PopL[l, l2, L]], {l, L}]];\n(* weight sectors, raising operators, bra *)\nsectorsOf[LL_] := sectorsOf[LL] = Module[{tup = Tuples[Range[nn], LL], sg = Table[If[OddQ[s], 1, -1], {s, LL}], W},\n    W = Sum[sg[[s]] IdentityMatrix[nn][[tup[[All, s]]]], {s, LL}];\n    GroupBy[Range[nn^LL], W[[#]] &]];\nJopL[LL_, i_, j_] := JopL[LL, i, j] = Sum[siteOpL[s, rho[typesOf[LL][[s]]][i, j], LL], {s, LL}];\nO2 = <|\"A\" -> UnitVector[nn, 1], \"F\" -> UnitVector[nn, 4]|>; O3 = <|\"A\" -> UnitVector[nn, 1] - UnitVector[nn, 4], \"F\" -> UnitVector[nn, 4] + UnitVector[nn, 1]|>;\nbraV[LL_, l_] := Flatten[Outer[Times, Sequence @@ Table[If[s <= l, O2[typesOf[LL][[s]]], O3[typesOf[LL][[s]]]], {s, LL}]]];\ndyn[w_] := -Differences[w];\n\"setup done\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"37\" data-out-n=\"446\" data-sub-idx=\"37\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"44\" data-sub-end=\"44\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[446]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7c2V0dXAgZG9uZX0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">setup done</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
