       "data": "Out[478]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{time (s)} & 1432.2726041\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# HW cyclic states} & 152\\\\\\hline\\text{min joint gap} & 0.00645494802725618\\\\\\hline\\text{max ‖H$\\Psi$−E$\\Psi$‖} & 3.547204763115912\\times 10^{-13}\\\\\\hline\\text{max t̄₁ eigen residual} & 9.812108180652573\\times 10^{-15}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
