  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Save the verified states\n\nAll three runs: every state is an H_MZ eigenstate (≤ 3.5·10⁻¹³) and a t̄₁ eigenstate (≤ 10⁻¹⁴); joint t̄₁, t̄₃ spectrum non-degenerate (min gap 0.0065 at L = 4). Saved to `data/abjm-hw-states.wxf` (states as SparseArrays, nonzero only on their weight sector) so they need not be recomputed: `states = Import[\"…/data/abjm-hw-states.wxf\"]; states[\"L4\"]`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* data folder next to this notebook *)\ndataDir = \"c:\\\\Users\\\\pryan\\\\git-projects\\\\abjm-c123\\\\Paul\\\\Mathematica\\\\su4-alternating\\\\data\";\nIf[!DirectoryQ[dataDir], CreateDirectory[dataDir]];\npack[sts_] := Map[KeyDrop[#, {\"psi\"}] ~Join~ <|\"psi\" -> SparseArray[Chop[#psi, 10^-14]]|> &, sts];\nsaved = <|\n   \"description\" -> \"ABJM su(4) alternating chain, untwisted, homogeneous at the ABJM point theta_A = theta_F + 2h (h = 1/2). All highest-weight, cyclic (pair-shift S = 1) joint eigenstates of tbar1(u), tbar3(u) (Laxes of dual-lax-t3.wb / abjm-chain.wb), L = number of pairs, 2L sites A F A F ..., A: rho(E_ij) = e_ij, F: rho(E_ij) = -e_ji, site 1 most significant in Flatten. psi normalised, phase: largest component real positive. Fields: w (weight), dyn (Dynkin), E (Minahan-Zarembo eigenvalue, H = sum(2 - 2P + PK + KP)), Hres, t1res, gap (joint spectral gap), LR (defect |tau1(u) - tau3(u+h)|/|tau1(u)|), Peig (<psi|P_LR psi>, P_LR = Weyl reversal o one-site shift), C (C_l = <B_l|psi>, l = 0..2L, bra of abjm-LR-symmetry.wb). Generated by abjm-LR-symmetry.wb on 2026-10-12.\",\n   \"L2\" -> pack[st2], \"L3\" -> pack[st3], \"L4\" -> pack[st4]|>;\nfile = FileNameJoin[{dataDir, \"abjm-hw-states.wxf\"}];\nExport[file, saved, \"WXF\", PerformanceGoal -> \"Size\"];\nre = Import[file, \"WXF\"];\nGrid[{{\"file\", file}, {\"size (MB)\", N[FileByteCount[file]/10^6]},\n  {\"# states L = 2, 3, 4\", Length /@ {re[\"L2\"], re[\"L3\"], re[\"L4\"]}},\n  {\"max |psi_saved − psi| (L = 4)\", Max[MapThread[Norm[Normal[#1[\"psi\"]] - #2[\"psi\"]] &, {re[\"L4\"], st4}]]},\n  {\"max ‖HΨ−EΨ‖ over all L\", Max[#Hres & /@ Join[st2, st3, st4]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
