       "data": "Out[494]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{file} & \\text{c:\\\\Users\\\\pryan\\\\git-projects\\\\abjm-c123\\\\Paul\\\\Mathematica\\\\su4-alternating\\\\data\\\\abjm-hw-states.wxf}\\\\\\hline\\text{size (MB)} & 0.779676\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# states L = 2, 3, 4} & \\left\\{6,26,152\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{max |psi\\_saved − psi| (L = 4)} & 3.0722632682069094\\times 10^{-14}\\\\\\hline\\text{max ‖H$\\Psi$−E$\\Psi$‖ over all L} & 3.547204763115912\\times 10^{-13}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
