  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** [𝒬, H_MZ] = 0 (10⁻¹⁶), 𝒬 S 𝒬⁻¹ = S⁻¹, and **𝒬 t̄₁(u) 𝒬⁻¹ = t̄₁(2h − u)** (2·10⁻¹⁶). So 𝒬 is the parity of the chain: a joint eigenstate is 𝒬-symmetric iff τ̄₁(u) = τ̄₁(2h−u); otherwise it pairs with 𝒬Ψ (H_MZ-degenerate). Together with 𝒫 (τ̄₁(u) ↔ τ̄₃(u+h)) this gives two Z₂'s.\n\n### Classification of all states by both Z₂'s and by which C_ℓ vanish\n\nFor [p,0,p] the R-charge-allowed bridges are L−p ≤ ℓ ≤ L+p. Split them into \"main\" ℓ ≡ L+p (mod 2) and \"off\" ℓ ≡ L+p+1 (mod 2). Columns: q = ⟨Ψ|𝒬Ψ⟩, 𝒫-overlap, whether the main and off bridges are all zero.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "classify[LL_, st_] := Module[{p = st[\"dyn\"][[1]], L = LL/2, allowed, main, off, c = Abs[st[\"C\"]], q},\n   allowed = Range[Max[0, L - p], Min[LL, L + p]];\n   main = Select[allowed, EvenQ[# - L - p] &]; off = Select[allowed, OddQ[# - L - p] &];\n   q = Chop[Conjugate[st[\"psi\"]] . QR[LL][st[\"psi\"]], 10^-8];\n   <|\"L\" -> L, \"dyn\" -> st[\"dyn\"], \"E\" -> st[\"E\"], \"LR\" -> st[\"LR\"] < 10^-8, \"Peig\" -> Chop[st[\"Peig\"], 10^-8], \"q\" -> q,\n    \"mainZero\" -> And @@ Thread[c[[main + 1]] < 10^-8], \"offZero\" -> And @@ Thread[c[[off + 1]] < 10^-8], \"nz\" -> nz[st]|>];\nallCls = Join[classify[4, #] & /@ st2, classify[6, #] & /@ st3, classify[8, #] & /@ st4];\npp = Select[allCls, #dyn[[1]] == #dyn[[3]] && #dyn[[2]] == 0 &];\nsumRows = KeyValueMap[Join[#1, {Length[#2], Counts[{Round[Abs[#q], 10.^-6], #offZero, #mainZero} & /@ #2]}] &,\n   GroupBy[pp, {#L, #dyn, OddQ[#L + #dyn[[1]]]} &]];\nGrid[Prepend[sumRows, {\"L\", \"Dynkin\", \"L+p odd\", \"# states\", \"counts of {|⟨Ψ|𝒬Ψ⟩|, off bridges all 0, main bridges all 0}\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"50\" data-out-n=\"511\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"15\" data-sub-start=\"10\" data-sub-end=\"10\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[511]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:15.64em;vertical-align:-7.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:15.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-7.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">L</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41